# Codex Subagent

* "Spawn a codex subagent" means running the `codex` CLI non-interactively in
the background. Write the prompt to a file in /tmp and run:
`codex exec -C <repo> -s workspace-write --add-dir ~/.cargo -o <result.md> - < <prompt-file>`
